  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>256</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, on simplifying we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>256</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>256</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>220</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1696</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>212</mn></math></p><p>So, maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>212</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
